+# Phase 03 continuation — owner handoffs and destination acceptance
+
+Completed Delivery 08 locally: corrected the generic cash-drawer route with a conservative existing/open plus destination/read permission intersection; localized owner metadata and proof defaults; repaired payroll proof close copy and keyboard focus return.
+
+132 mocked tests, scoped semantic TypeScript and scoped ESLint passed. Browser acceptance now includes French owner action/purchase-order pending feedback and arrival, payroll command/payments/register/declarations, inventory catalogue/loss and the actual cash-drawer destination. Payroll proof Escape/focus return was verified after the edit. No financial actions, migrations, seeds, build or deployment were run. Navigation can generate ordinary authorization audit records.
+
+Full files, reviewed commands, role/locale/viewport/state smoke notes, rollback and limitations: [Delivery 08](../../docs/system-audit/2026-10-12-ui-ux-review/roadmap/EXECUTION-08.md). Source ownership: `delivery-08-files.json` beside the report's evidence. Four production files and their focused tests changed, plus roadmap/evidence documents.
+
+Phase status: partial acceptance, not whole-phase completion. Restricted roles, true target viewport/theme matrix, reconciliation content and actual screen-reader checks remain. Next safe slice: continue Phase 03 owner/shared evidence presentation and acceptance; do not claim later POS/workbench or growth packages are complete.
